Directive_AllPlayersWeaponTokensBattle=All players take all their {icon:s3_weapontoken} tokens into their hands. For each battle, starting with the upper-most territory (marked by the Occult cube), players secretly decide how many tokens to place into their right hand and extend their fist to the center of the table. Once all players have decided, all players reveal their tokens.
