Directive_CannotPerform_LoseVPGainServant=_If a player cannot perform this action, they lose 3VP and gain a Servant/Spouse piece from Lost to place onto the Hunter's Haven._
Directive_CaretakerTownActions_Rule=Caretaker pieces can now take actions in Town as well as in the Estates. _The same Town placement rules for Servants apply to Caretaker pieces._
