Directive_EachPlayerPays1EstateTax=Each player **pays $1** in estate tax to the supply.
Directive_ElectionWinnerPaysBid=Only the player who wins the election must pay their bid to the supply. The other returns their money to their Estate.
Directive_EmpireAdvancedWeaponryDeck=The Empire has decided to expand by utilizing the implements of destruction which you have provided. You may draw a card from the Advanced Weaponry deck when taking any action that allows you to draw Experiments. When you complete the Experiment you will receive {icon:s3_weapontoken} tokens equal to the amount listed at the bottom of the card.
Directive_EndGeneration_DubiousBartering=Remove all player pieces from the board and Perform the End of a Generation. Return all **Dubious Bartering** cards to the box. Return any remaining {icon:storybook} tokens to the supply.
Directive_EndGeneration_JournalTrackTokens=Remove all player pieces from the board and perform the End of a Generation. Any {icon:storybook} tokens remaining on a player's Journal Track are returned to the supply.
Directive_EndGeneration_PlayersKeepWeaponTokens=Remove all player pieces from the board and perform the End of the Generation. Players keep all {icon:s3_weapontoken} tokens they acquired.
Directive_EndGeneration_ReturnMasterworkParadoxToQuarters=Remove all player pieces from the board and perform the End of a Generation. Return your Masterwork face-up once again. Any {icon:s3_paradoxtoken} tokens remaining on your Experiments are moved into your Quarters.
Directive_EngineeringMastersStudy_Rule=When you gain a Vanity Estate Upgrade, the **Engineering Master's Study** is part of the available pool to build as normal.
Directive_FirstPlayerComplete2AdvancedWeaponry_Fragment=The first player to complete **2 Advanced Weaponry** Experiments 
