Directive_RevealAtLeast1TokenForPoints=_You must reveal at least 1 token to receive points. If no player reveals a token, then no players score VP and the next battle begins._
Directive_SeparatistsUrgeRallyReward=The Separatists urge citizens to rally to their cause. They do not require a player to offer their service, but will incentivize this dedication to the cause with a reward each round.
Directive_ServantOnlyBuilding_Rule=You may only place a Servant/Spouse piece on this building. This action causes you to pay $1 to the supply. Then, at the end of the round, any piece on this building will become Lost.
Directive_SpeakPeoplePoliticalClimate_Fragment=In addition, you will speak with the people to more fully understand the political climate. 
Directive_SubstituteWeaponTokenForIngredient=When performing an Experiment, you may substitute 1 {icon:s3_weapontoken} token for any 1 required Ingredient. _You may only do this once per Experiment._
Directive_TimelineStabilizedUtopianBonus=With the timeline somewhat stabilized, advanced labors can continue. Anytime you complete a **Utopian Experiment**, gain **2 additional VP**.
Directive_TrackerAndMobMarkerLeft=**{tracker}** and the {icon:angrymob_icon} Marker one space to the left.
Directive_TurnToPage16=Turn to page **16** of the Village Chronicle.
