Number_Two_Lower=two
Pub_ResetCreepy_Rule=If your token is overtaken by the {icon:angrymob_icon}, in addition to visiting the Church you can also visit any Pub. When you visit a Pub marked with a {icon:creepy_icon} and 0 symbol, **reset your** {icon:creepy_icon} **to zero** by buying a couple rounds at the Pub. Then, immediately 
