Resource_KnowledgeMovesCreepyTrack_Rule=At the end of each round, each player will **move one space forward on the** {icon:creepy_icon} **Track for each Knowledge cube in their Estate**.
Reward_ClosestToCrownToken_Gain6VP=At the End of the Generation, the player(s) closest to the {icon:s3_crowntoken} token on the {icon:creepy_icon} Track without overlapping or exceeding it will **gain 6VP**.
Reward_DecreesGainDecbonVP_Fragment= decrees will gain **{decbon}VP** at the End of the Generation.
Reward_EndGenerationGainTile_Fragment= at the end of the Generation will gain this tile for no cost. _If there is a tie, the one with the fewest VP receives the tile._
