Round_StartMiddleYears_Rule=Then, perform all Start of Round actions for the Middle Years before continuing.
SchoolForHybridizedIndividuals_Rule=When a player visits the **School for Hybridized Individuals**, they **pay $1** to gain a **Caretaker** piece from Lost. 
